e color: Reddish\nHair color: White/silver\nHairstyle: Bob to long (I leave it to you to braid or put hair in a bun. You don't need a chignon.)\nBangs: Patted\nAntennae: With princess cut\nSkin color: Please use skin color this time.\nEye color: Brown/yellow/gold\nEye shape: Parallel eyes (Jito-eye?)\nOther features: Marrow eyebrows (short eyebrows are also acceptable), jagged teeth\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Jiangshi_Jis", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yb_shiroo/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1672993, "client_id": 2031015, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=378f895619c2134918c34410c81b6df6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=378f895619c2134918c34410c81b6df6, https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a5e697ea51b220796e263949d157447 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a6deb640d80bf665c206428d942a00c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6098ce90dd01ec5419dd0f394e1ad305", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fae3d0e7/uploads/origins/bf5de2c4-dd65-49d9-b6ca-5a762178bcd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit